b5c4e04a74 wallet: Store multipath relative spkm ids in WalletDescriptor

3b0b34b1ca wallet, rpc: Store multipath relative ids on import

78e46193fc wallet, export: Export multipath relative ids for exportwatchonly

ce22333956 wallet, export, rpc: also list original multipath descriptors

81b6a29842 wallet: Store automatically created descriptors as multipath

f57989d701 test: Check for multipath descriptors in listdescriptors

Check that the correct multipath descriptor appears in listdescriptors
for a typical single key wallet. Also check that the correct
non-multipath descriptors appears, and also do for private
listdescriptors.
